window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Crashing into my brothers' best friends was a mistake. Letting them stay might be an even bigger one.</b></p> <p>After I rear-ended their truck, I thought I'd just get a lecture and be done. But when Dean, Reed, and Lennon decided to move onto our ranch to help out, things got complicated fast. They're not just here to work—they're here to keep an eye on me, whether I like it or not.</p> <p>Dean's gruff attitude could freeze over Hell—especially when he calls me reckless. He made it clear after the accident that he thinks I need supervision.</p> <p>Reed's a cocky flirt who thinks tossing me over his shoulder is a great way to win an argument.</p> <p>And Lennon, with his gentle smile, has a hidden steel resolve—he'll do whatever it takes to keep me in line.</p> <p>They're my brothers' best friends, and they think they know best. Too bad for them, I'm not the kind of girl who takes orders.</p> <p>But danger is closing in, and they're not backing down. How am I supposed to keep my heart intact when they're ready to risk everything for me?</p> <p>Taken by My Brothers' Best Friends <i>is a sizzling reverse harem romance filled with alpha ex-military men, steamy tension, and a guaranteed happily ever after. Get ready for a wild ride of love, danger, and passion! For mature listeners.</i></p>"; 
